extends emailBase

block content
    p Hi #{firstName},
    p We'll need to confirm your request to change your email address on Natours.
    p If you did not request this change then please ignore this message and DO NOT click on the link below.
    p Otherwise we can confirm this new email address as yours by clicking the link below to confirm the change, but please be quick as the link will expire in 10 minutes.
    p This is a security measure to avoid your account being compromised by someone with bad intentions.
    table.btn.btn-primary(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
        tbody
            tr
                td(align='left')
                    table(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
                        tbody
                            tr
                                td
                                    a(href=`${url}`, target='_blank') Confirm Email Change
    p Please keep your login details private, we're here to keep you safe.